    "body": "Seals qcells lab exp011 — the reach-class mutator test on the exact exp005 unaided n=3 GHZ-balance lane (no seed, targets (\"000\",\"111\"), mode=balance, jitter-dropped replace/indel, root 7 / train 101 / verify 202 / 512 shots, 12 gens x pop 16).\n\n**Three arms, three outcomes:**\n- **two_move** (mutate_classed twice per child — doubles neighborhood diameter per draw): FROZEN at the 0.2422 partial plateau\n- **parent_pool** (each child mutated from a parent sampled uniformly from champion + already-generated children): **CROSSES UNSEEDED** — verify 0.4824 (247/512) at gen 5, frozen there through gen 11. First unaided crossing in the lab.\n- **both**: FROZEN at 0.2422\n\n**Doctrine update:** draws don't fix the freeze (exp009/exp010); move-count doesn't (two_move); *genealogy* does — once. exp012 replicated the parent_pool arm across 3 fresh root seeds: 0/3 crossed. The crossing is a **root-lottery (1-in-4 rate)**, never quote as 'genealogy fixes the freeze'.\n\n**Load-bearing pins (tests/test_exp011_receipt.py, 11 tests):**\n- pi-expansion honesty pin (exp008): raw 0.5-rad sim does NOT reproduce the sealed balances\n- cross-receipt: both-arm gen-0 genome == exp005 frozen champion (born at the freeze, walked away)\n- cross-receipt: crossing balance 0.482421875 == exp006 seeded GHZ-prefix crossing balance (two routes, one GHZ witness)\n- 21-row witness ledger, fnv1a chain re-derived in-repo, seeded WORLD row, tamper-trip demo\n\nFAIL-first: 11 RED on pristine main; full suite **113/113 green** (includes regenerated import-baseline).",
