    "body": "Seals qcells lab exp010 as the lane's sixth experiment receipt.\n\n- Exact exp005 unaided lane (no seed, balance witness, exp004 jitter-drop policy, named seeds root7/train101/verify202/shots512) swept at pop 16/32/64, 12 gens each: byte-identical champion [h(1),cx(2,0),x(2)], train/verify 0.000, zero promotions at 4x draw budget.\n- Verdict: POP-INVARIANT FREEZE — population multiplies draws, not reach; freeze contributes 3 configs to the unaided 0/11 crossing-rate table (exp012–exp014 doctrine).\n- Load-bearing cross-receipt pin: same program as exp005's freeze, per-gate statevector digests + WORLD histogram re-derive byte-identical to exp005's ledger.\n- 15-row witness ledger, PROOF head 5b7e7dd7b67d9542, replay OK; 11 pins FAIL-first RED on pristine main; suite 113/113 green; baseline regenerated WITH change per doctrine.",
